	"Game-Faction-Harbinger-Desc": "Harbinger-31: Heavy Weapons\nUnits:\n  • Obliterator\n  • Marauder (replaces Intruder)\n\nPowers:\n  • Buzzer Swarm\n\nUpgrades:\n  • Stellar Fusion Cannon\n\nBonuses:\n  • Devastator Warship (10% discount)\n  • Mothership (10% discount)",
