	"Game-Faction-Legion-Desc": "Legion: Stolen Technology\nUnits:\n  • Microwave Tank\n  • APC\n  • Battle Tank (replaces Light Tank)\n\nPowers:\n  • Cash Hack\n  • Technology Hack\n\nUpgrades:\n  • Intensified Microwaves\n\nBonuses:\n  • Stolen Technology Units (10% discount)\n  • Hack Satellite (-33% cooldown)",
